# Visual regression captures. Regenerated deterministically in ~40s from any
# commit, and ~20MB a run, so the scripts are tracked and the output is not.
# Only this directory -- `tests/visual/*/` also swallowed tests/visual/figma/,
# which is the generator, its node map and the raw Figma responses, and git
# cannot re-include a path whose parent directory is excluded.
v1-prototype/tests/visual/captures/
